<title>USA: US corn gluten meal prices up in moderate trade.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten meal prices up in moderate trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal values were higher Monday in moderate trade, while pellet prices were steady, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
