<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     May	-  343.00    340.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   89.00     89.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    340.00</p>
